WEBVTT

01:33.450 --> 01:35.420
(Adapted from the web novel "Waiting for You in a City")

01:35.491 --> 01:37.920
(Fireworks of My Heart)

01:37.991 --> 01:40.861
(Episode 40)

01:53.670 --> 01:54.870
What's wrong? What happened?

01:55.471 --> 01:57.040
The manhole cover is broken.

01:57.340 --> 01:58.510
Don't drive this way.

01:59.111 --> 01:59.941
It's too dangerous.

02:00.881 --> 02:01.611
No.

02:02.111 --> 02:03.480
How long have you been standing here?

02:03.881 --> 02:05.381
You can't just stand here the entire time.

02:05.721 --> 02:07.120
I called the city hall.

02:07.180 --> 02:08.620
They're stuck in traffic.

02:09.891 --> 02:10.891
It's okay. I'll wait.

02:11.150 --> 02:12.090
It's too dangerous.

02:12.491 --> 02:13.320
No, this won't do.

02:13.391 --> 02:14.790
You can't keep standing in the rain.

02:33.780 --> 02:34.810
You don't have to worry about this.

02:34.880 --> 02:36.280
Find shelter from the rain.

02:36.350 --> 02:37.951
It's okay. It won't take long.

02:38.481 --> 02:39.380
Why are you working overtime...

02:39.451 --> 02:40.581
in this weather?

02:41.951 --> 02:43.090
Why are you working overtime...

02:43.150 --> 02:44.590
in this weather?

02:45.821 --> 02:47.560
Work more, make more money.

02:47.620 --> 02:48.861
I have to pay for my child's tuition.

02:52.000 --> 02:52.831
You know what?

02:52.961 --> 02:54.361
My daughter got into Yan University.

02:54.970 --> 02:56.271
School is starting soon.

02:59.440 --> 03:01.071
Your daughter is so lucky.

03:01.940 --> 03:02.711
Congratulations.

03:03.011 --> 03:03.810
Thank you.

03:04.511 --> 03:05.641
I'm done here.

03:11.551 --> 03:13.250
All right. It'll be fine now.

03:13.481 --> 03:15.090
You should go and find a place to shelter from the rain.

03:15.150 --> 03:16.951
Okay. Thank you, sir.

03:17.491 --> 03:18.220
Bye.

03:58.861 --> 03:59.961
Sir, are you all right?

04:01.900 --> 04:03.370
Are you all right, sir?

04:08.870 --> 04:09.840
Anyone?

04:12.211 --> 04:14.481
Is anyone there?

04:22.951 --> 04:23.720
Help!

04:24.121 --> 04:25.561
- Help! - Stop the car.

04:32.360 --> 04:33.160
Help!

04:33.400 --> 04:35.071
There's a person stuck there.

04:35.771 --> 04:36.431
- There's a guy. - What's wrong?

04:36.501 --> 04:38.771
- He's pinned under the bicycles. - Come and move those!

04:38.871 --> 04:39.600
- Yes! - Yes!

04:41.871 --> 04:42.641
Slowly.

04:43.011 --> 04:43.871
There's someone down there.

04:44.011 --> 04:44.740
Slowly.

04:48.110 --> 04:48.881
Be careful.

05:00.160 --> 05:01.831
My daughter got into Yan University.

05:02.131 --> 05:03.590
Work more, make more money.

05:03.660 --> 05:05.001
I have to pay for my child's tuition.

05:20.581 --> 05:22.850
(Ambulance)

05:31.321 --> 05:32.821
- The doctor is here. - What's the situation?

05:34.021 --> 05:34.961
What's the situation?

05:35.191 --> 05:36.131
This man just drowned.

05:36.191 --> 05:37.391
He was pinned under bicycles.

05:39.400 --> 05:40.561
Put him in the ambulance.

05:40.761 --> 05:41.530
Hurry up.

05:41.600 --> 05:42.670
His internal organs might be injured.

05:42.871 --> 05:43.771
Carry him.

05:50.670 --> 05:51.610
Hurry.

05:51.811 --> 05:52.581
Be careful.

05:59.381 --> 06:00.121
Drive faster.

06:00.181 --> 06:01.081
The water is too deep.

06:01.150 --> 06:02.050
Our car is too low.

06:02.121 --> 06:03.090
I'm afraid we can't get through.

06:03.691 --> 06:05.021
Jiang Yi, clear the way with the fire truck.

06:05.090 --> 06:05.920
Okay.

07:11.920 --> 07:13.561
Jiang Yi, what's the situation up ahead?

07:13.990 --> 07:15.831
Chief, a tree fell ahead.

07:16.561 --> 07:18.061
- Clear the road quickly. - Yes, Chief!

07:23.230 --> 07:24.571
There's someone under the tree.

07:28.170 --> 07:29.410
One over there.

07:29.610 --> 07:31.441
The rest, over here. Come and help me lift it.

07:31.511 --> 07:32.740
- Okay. - Help me!

07:32.811 --> 07:34.941
One, two, three.

07:35.881 --> 07:38.181
One, two, three.

07:41.280 --> 07:42.121
Is it this leg?

07:42.191 --> 07:42.990
Can you walk?

07:49.061 --> 07:50.030
Regulator to the maximum.

07:52.660 --> 07:53.600
Come on, one more time.

07:53.800 --> 07:56.201
One, two, three.

08:01.840 --> 08:03.871
Chief, the road is clear.

08:05.071 --> 08:06.211
Jiang Yi, drive faster.

08:06.280 --> 08:07.410
- Faster. - Okay.

08:12.951 --> 08:13.650
Song Yan.

08:13.881 --> 08:15.220
The patient's blood pressure is too low.

08:15.290 --> 08:16.350
He can't last 30 minutes.

08:16.420 --> 08:17.821
We have to get to the hospital as soon as possible.

08:21.831 --> 08:22.631
Command center.

08:23.230 --> 08:24.530
This is Song Yan of Shilitai.

08:24.990 --> 08:26.860
There's a patient in the car who needs urgent rescue.

08:27.331 --> 08:28.631
Please coordinate with the Traffic Department...

08:29.470 --> 08:30.571
to open the green corridor!

08:31.470 --> 08:32.470
Command center, copy that.

08:33.201 --> 08:34.441
- Ventilator. - Okay.

08:41.510 --> 08:42.911
Mr. Song, the patient is not breathing.

08:42.980 --> 08:43.850
Drive faster.

08:44.480 --> 08:45.321
Jiang Yi!

08:45.951 --> 08:46.651
Drive faster!

08:46.720 --> 08:48.421
Copy that! Faster.

08:48.480 --> 08:49.250
Yes.

09:05.671 --> 09:06.801
Chief Song.

09:07.041 --> 09:08.811
This is the traffic control center.

09:09.071 --> 09:11.470
We've been informed of your situation and location.

09:11.671 --> 09:13.610
Due to the heavy traffic caused by the typhoon,

09:13.711 --> 09:15.041
there are many flooded areas.

09:15.181 --> 09:16.980
The green corridor can't be opened all the way.

09:17.181 --> 09:18.720
We can only guide you...

09:18.781 --> 09:19.720
to the fastest route possible...

09:19.850 --> 09:21.350
and open some parts of the green corridor.

09:21.421 --> 09:22.520
We're sending real-time traffic...

09:22.590 --> 09:23.990
to your tablet now.

09:24.590 --> 09:25.321
Copy that.

09:33.931 --> 09:35.901
Jiang Yi, the water is deep ahead.

09:36.000 --> 09:37.970
Turn left at the next junction to Chunhai Road.

09:38.100 --> 09:39.171
Got it.

09:39.370 --> 09:41.301
Turn left at the next junction to Chunhai Road.

09:44.941 --> 09:46.211
Command center.

09:46.340 --> 09:47.610
We're going through Huahan Community...

09:47.681 --> 09:48.711
Blocks A and C.

09:48.951 --> 09:50.281
We're going to the hospital downtown.

09:50.850 --> 09:52.081
Please coordinate.

09:53.850 --> 09:55.220
Hello, security.

09:55.990 --> 09:57.151
Okay, got it.

09:57.750 --> 10:00.360
- Hurry, this way. - Hurry.

10:00.421 --> 10:02.730
- Hurry! - Quick!

10:03.191 --> 10:04.130
Be careful.

10:40.461 --> 10:41.431
We're almost at the hospital.

10:41.600 --> 10:42.701
Prepare to get the injured out of the car.

10:50.671 --> 10:51.740
Hurry, watch his leg.

10:51.811 --> 10:52.640
Watch his leg.

11:35.620 --> 11:36.590
Chief, eat up.

11:36.890 --> 11:37.620
Get some energy.

11:37.951 --> 11:38.791
Jun Ping.

11:39.161 --> 11:40.020
Xiao Ge.

12:09.791 --> 12:10.590
Hurry.

12:12.561 --> 12:13.791
Help!

12:15.390 --> 12:16.661
Help!

12:22.201 --> 12:23.401
Hurry, it's collapsing!

12:23.470 --> 12:24.701
Get out of here!

12:24.870 --> 12:26.470
Hurry! It's collapsing!

12:26.671 --> 12:27.640
Hurry!

12:29.640 --> 12:30.470
Ming Yu!

12:35.340 --> 12:36.281
Hurry!

12:36.951 --> 12:38.281
- Ming Yu! - Get outside!

12:38.350 --> 12:40.451
- It's collapsing! - Help!

12:41.380 --> 12:42.890
Help!

13:16.490 --> 13:17.291
Mr. Wu.

13:18.220 --> 13:19.161
Mr. Wu!

13:21.961 --> 13:22.831
Is anyone there?

13:22.931 --> 13:24.661
Is anyone there?

13:26.931 --> 13:28.100
Get out of here!

13:28.161 --> 13:30.831
- Is anyone there to help? - Get out of here!

13:33.441 --> 13:35.041
- Help! - Hurry!

13:35.401 --> 13:36.240
Come on.

13:36.340 --> 13:37.441
Come out!

13:37.610 --> 13:39.010
Don't think about the car now.

13:39.081 --> 13:41.010
If the car floods, we won't be able to open the door!

13:42.551 --> 13:43.480
Go that way.

13:43.980 --> 13:44.880
It's going to collapse.

13:46.081 --> 13:46.880
Is anyone there?

13:49.151 --> 13:49.951
Hurry up.

14:02.470 --> 14:03.770
Hello, 119.

14:05.671 --> 14:06.870
How many people are trapped inside?

14:06.970 --> 14:08.071
Hello, 119.

14:09.311 --> 14:10.541
A collapse in the Fengshan Tunnel?

14:11.140 --> 14:12.811
What's the status of the casualties?

14:13.840 --> 14:14.781
Many are trapped.

14:14.941 --> 14:15.681
Okay.

14:15.880 --> 14:17.110
- Please take shelter in the open. - Hello, 119.

14:17.181 --> 14:18.110
Keep your phones on.

14:18.181 --> 14:19.120
Help is on the way.

14:19.451 --> 14:20.750
This is the command center.

14:20.951 --> 14:22.321
This is the command center.

14:22.890 --> 14:25.220
There's a collapse in Fengshan Tunnel.

14:25.561 --> 14:27.661
There's a collapse in Fengshan Tunnel.

14:27.720 --> 14:29.831
Many people are trapped in wading vehicles.

14:30.031 --> 14:31.691
Please go to the fire and rescue station nearby...

14:31.760 --> 14:32.760
for backup.

14:36.031 --> 14:37.470
I'm Song Yan of Shilitai.

14:38.431 --> 14:41.041
We're near the site of the collapse.

14:41.201 --> 14:42.340
We're moving now.

14:43.711 --> 14:44.411
Let's go!

14:44.470 --> 14:46.281
- Let's go! - Let's go!

14:46.640 --> 14:48.181
- Go. - Go.

15:10.801 --> 15:12.470
Split up and search. Search carefully.

15:12.600 --> 15:13.600
- Okay. - Okay.

15:21.081 --> 15:22.041
Help!

15:22.140 --> 15:24.151
Please save my sister!

15:24.350 --> 15:25.821
She's stuck in the car.

15:25.880 --> 15:27.250
I can't open the door.

15:27.451 --> 15:28.321
Leave it to us.

15:28.551 --> 15:29.250
Don't worry.

15:29.321 --> 15:30.490
- Don't worry. - Don't worry. We'll save her.

15:30.551 --> 15:31.921
There was heavy rain just now.

15:31.990 --> 15:32.791
Don't worry.

15:38.331 --> 15:39.401
- Toothless saw. - Pi Pi!

15:39.600 --> 15:41.031
- Toothless saw. - Coming.

15:42.531 --> 15:43.370
Chief.

15:43.630 --> 15:44.801
I'll check the front.

15:52.110 --> 15:53.081
Help!

15:53.880 --> 15:55.110
Wake up!

15:55.281 --> 15:56.681
Don't scare me, honey!

15:56.750 --> 15:57.781
- Wake up! - Leave it to me.

15:57.911 --> 15:58.850
- Save him! - Sir!

15:58.911 --> 15:59.781
Quick!

16:00.051 --> 16:00.921
Wake up!

16:17.770 --> 16:18.531
Done.

16:19.571 --> 16:20.370
Ming Yu!

16:20.901 --> 16:22.171
Ming Yu, are you okay?

16:22.240 --> 16:23.541
Please save her.

16:23.911 --> 16:25.541
Ming Yu!

16:25.610 --> 16:26.941
- Stretcher. - Stretcher.

16:27.541 --> 16:28.480
Thank you.

16:28.541 --> 16:29.681
Thank you.

17:00.941 --> 17:02.681
- Hello. - Please help me. My mom fainted!

17:02.750 --> 17:04.380
- Please move aside. - Ma'am.

17:04.711 --> 17:05.451
Hang in there.

17:05.510 --> 17:06.850
Xiao Ge, let's go.

17:10.791 --> 17:11.821
Thank you.

17:12.020 --> 17:12.820
- Thank you. - Go!

17:23.201 --> 17:24.000
Chief!

17:25.470 --> 17:27.000
Everyone has been evacuated.

17:27.300 --> 17:28.040
But it seems like...

17:28.270 --> 17:29.711
there's still a risk of a second cave-in.

17:29.841 --> 17:30.611
- Let's get out of here. - Go.

18:03.841 --> 18:04.871
Step back!

18:05.211 --> 18:06.010
Cover your head!

19:10.270 --> 19:11.841
- Pi Pi, help. - Okay.

19:14.841 --> 19:16.080
Stretcher!

19:52.151 --> 19:53.050
Hurry.

19:54.550 --> 19:55.480
- Hurry. - Catch.

20:00.820 --> 20:01.891
Look at that.

20:01.961 --> 20:03.861
These firefighters are really good.

20:03.931 --> 20:05.490
Yes. Thank goodness for them.

20:05.560 --> 20:06.931
Otherwise, we would've been in trouble.

20:07.000 --> 20:07.931
Yes.

20:08.000 --> 20:09.431
...a 10km traffic.

20:09.631 --> 20:10.970
The firefighter who carried you just now,

20:11.030 --> 20:12.070
do you know him?

20:12.470 --> 20:14.171
Wind force will drop from six to five.

20:14.240 --> 20:16.441
Typhoon warning changed from red to yellow.

20:16.841 --> 20:18.211
All rescue teams, please be careful.

20:18.270 --> 20:19.611
Thank you for your hard work.

20:30.121 --> 20:32.290
He's my daughter's boyfriend.

20:44.201 --> 20:45.201
Let's go.

20:45.371 --> 20:46.941
Get in.

20:47.000 --> 20:48.770
- Get in. - Let's go.

22:27.500 --> 22:29.941
(Emergency number, Daily report, 19, Report calls, 601)

23:01.040 --> 23:02.201
You're awake.

23:03.141 --> 23:05.010
Keep an eye on his consciousness. I'll go find Dr. Xu.

23:05.070 --> 23:06.040
Okay.

23:06.480 --> 23:07.941
Hello, can you hear me?

23:08.010 --> 23:09.510
His blood pressure is stable today, right?

23:09.951 --> 23:10.611
Dr. Xu.

23:10.711 --> 23:11.750
Zhao Qian Jin is awake.

23:39.911 --> 23:44.750
(The patient we sent to the hospital together is awake.)

24:28.320 --> 24:29.290
This is for you.

24:30.461 --> 24:32.861
What is this?

24:34.361 --> 24:35.861
It looked ordinary.

24:36.770 --> 24:37.871
I didn't expect it...

24:39.970 --> 24:40.871
to be so pretty.

25:07.661 --> 25:08.631
The mystery box...

25:09.201 --> 25:10.401
is open.

25:39.961 --> 25:41.461
Shaggy dwarf morning-glory.

25:44.770 --> 25:46.841
"Mutual trust."

25:47.770 --> 25:49.000
"Seize the moment."

25:57.580 --> 25:58.651
Coming.

26:04.951 --> 26:05.750
You're here.

26:05.990 --> 26:06.790
Welcome.

26:08.091 --> 26:09.290
I just grounded some coffee beans.

26:23.411 --> 26:24.941
You have this book?

26:25.141 --> 26:26.010
Which one?

26:26.141 --> 26:27.510
"The Long Goodbye".

26:27.881 --> 26:29.010
It's out of print.

26:29.510 --> 26:30.280
This one.

26:32.080 --> 26:33.080
Let me help you.

26:50.800 --> 26:52.030
I looked for it for a long time.

26:52.570 --> 26:54.800
I found it at a used bookstore.

26:57.310 --> 26:58.111
I see.

27:17.161 --> 27:18.260
Which bookstore?

27:19.161 --> 27:20.461
Mingcheng Bookstore.

27:22.201 --> 27:23.000
Mingcheng?

27:26.970 --> 27:28.441
I used to go there often too.

27:28.701 --> 27:29.911
Why didn't I see you before?

27:30.441 --> 27:31.810
You have now.

27:36.211 --> 27:37.310
Not too early or too late.

27:37.980 --> 27:39.111
Just in time.

27:47.820 --> 27:48.591
Hello.

27:48.961 --> 27:50.361
- Hello. - Come.

27:53.131 --> 27:54.300
I only asked you to come...

27:54.361 --> 27:55.560
because I can't take it anymore.

27:56.000 --> 27:57.401
You'll know when you see it.

27:57.470 --> 27:58.431
The typhoon a few days ago...

27:58.570 --> 27:59.941
broke the security window on the balcony.

28:00.000 --> 28:01.000
The huge money tree...

28:01.070 --> 28:02.070
is too dangerous to be left hanging.

28:02.401 --> 28:03.470
Look.

28:04.611 --> 28:05.841
It's a safety hazard indeed.

28:06.141 --> 28:06.941
If one day...

28:07.010 --> 28:08.711
the tree goes down with the security window...

28:08.911 --> 28:09.980
and hits someone, it'll be dangerous.

28:19.550 --> 28:20.790
Here.

28:22.520 --> 28:23.661
Hello.

28:23.990 --> 28:24.661
Hello.

28:24.730 --> 28:26.161
You must be the chief.

28:26.260 --> 28:27.260
Sorry for the trouble.

28:27.401 --> 28:28.361
Sorry for the trouble.

28:28.560 --> 28:29.361
Chief.

28:29.431 --> 28:31.300
Can you not cut the tree down?

28:31.371 --> 28:32.401
How about...

28:32.701 --> 28:34.800
you take down the security window...

28:34.871 --> 28:36.740
and keep the tree?

28:36.841 --> 28:37.641
I'll take it with me.

28:37.740 --> 28:38.770
It's such a big tree.

28:38.871 --> 28:39.671
You'll take it with you?

28:40.310 --> 28:41.080
Yes.

28:41.540 --> 28:42.841
I called a truck.

28:43.881 --> 28:45.550
I plan to take this tree...

28:45.851 --> 28:46.951
with me.

28:47.351 --> 28:48.881
Because this tree...

28:49.891 --> 28:51.151
was planted by my mom.

28:51.891 --> 28:53.290
She passed away five years ago.

28:53.720 --> 28:54.961
I want to keep it as a memento.

29:00.800 --> 29:01.830
Seven years ago,

29:02.161 --> 29:03.300
my business failed.

29:03.800 --> 29:05.171
I was heavily in debt.

29:05.601 --> 29:06.671
At that time,

29:07.171 --> 29:07.871
my mom...

29:09.101 --> 29:10.711
planted this money tree.

29:11.010 --> 29:11.841
As long as...

29:12.010 --> 29:14.441
this money tree grew a little taller,

29:14.641 --> 29:16.550
my mom would send me a message on WeChat.

29:16.980 --> 29:17.810
She'd say,

29:18.310 --> 29:19.181
"My son,"

29:19.351 --> 29:20.651
"don't be discouraged."

29:21.250 --> 29:23.391
"Your luck will surely improve."

29:23.990 --> 29:27.091
My business is doing well now.

29:27.691 --> 29:29.931
But my mom is gone.

29:39.841 --> 29:40.641
Okay.

29:41.040 --> 29:43.070
Steady.

29:45.040 --> 29:45.740
Slowly.

29:49.441 --> 29:50.280
Sir.

29:50.780 --> 29:51.851
Please help me load it.

29:52.050 --> 29:53.881
Don't worry. Help lift it.

29:54.080 --> 29:55.320
- Okay. - Okay.

29:55.550 --> 29:57.290
Let's go. One, two, three, up.

29:57.351 --> 29:58.520
Slowly. Don't hit the door.

29:58.720 --> 29:59.591
Okay.

30:02.020 --> 30:03.361
Thank you, Chief.

30:04.530 --> 30:05.760
- Thank you. - It's what we should do.

30:05.830 --> 30:06.601
I troubled you.

30:08.861 --> 30:10.431
All parents are the same.

30:20.211 --> 30:21.080
Qin Qin.

30:22.240 --> 30:23.510
I heard from your brother...

30:23.681 --> 30:25.250
that you've been transferred from the ER.

30:26.111 --> 30:27.320
I'm at Outpatient now.

30:28.780 --> 30:29.951
That's great.

30:30.421 --> 30:31.290
Outpatient?

30:31.520 --> 30:32.621
It's just as tiring.

30:35.161 --> 30:36.530
It's still better than the ER.

30:37.030 --> 30:37.891
Here.

30:38.530 --> 30:39.730
Drink more.

30:40.730 --> 30:41.760
Thank you, Mom.

30:45.901 --> 30:47.101
Is the date for the wedding...

30:47.371 --> 30:48.240
all set?

30:48.470 --> 30:49.270
Yes.

30:49.441 --> 30:51.010
It's still a while until then.

30:51.341 --> 30:52.040
Then...

30:52.871 --> 30:54.280
how do you plan to hold it?

30:56.510 --> 30:58.151
Song Yan and I unanimously agreed...

30:58.280 --> 30:59.651
to keep it simple.

31:00.050 --> 31:01.121
We'll have a small...

31:01.181 --> 31:02.621
and simple wedding.

31:03.891 --> 31:05.220
That won't do.

31:05.320 --> 31:06.520
Marriage is an important matter.

31:06.820 --> 31:08.391
How can you keep it simple?

31:08.691 --> 31:09.391
Mom.

31:09.621 --> 31:11.330
It's her wedding, not...

31:13.931 --> 31:14.961
Fine.

31:15.361 --> 31:17.000
This is the Meng family's business.

31:17.070 --> 31:18.070
You have the final say.

31:18.901 --> 31:19.970
That's not what I mean.

31:20.270 --> 31:21.371
In my opinion,

31:21.441 --> 31:24.611
I think this matter should be up to them.

31:25.441 --> 31:26.810
If Qin Qin really wants...

31:26.881 --> 31:28.841
a quiet and simple wedding,

31:29.310 --> 31:30.580
then we'll let her have it.

31:34.381 --> 31:35.280
But Qin Qin,

31:35.480 --> 31:37.121
what about the wedding dress,

31:37.351 --> 31:38.921
the tradition of the father walking the daughter down the aisle,

31:39.290 --> 31:41.060
and the ceremony of accepting...

31:41.121 --> 31:42.361
both parents' blessings?

31:42.421 --> 31:44.060
All these are included, right?

31:51.500 --> 31:52.371
Yes.

31:53.570 --> 31:54.371
Look.

31:54.441 --> 31:55.641
It's all in.

31:57.841 --> 31:58.611
Let's eat.

32:03.651 --> 32:04.681
It'll get cold.

32:05.050 --> 32:05.911
Drink up.

32:27.871 --> 32:28.641
Coming.

32:36.310 --> 32:37.881
Didn't you say you'd come tonight?

32:37.951 --> 32:39.080
Why are you here now?

32:39.980 --> 32:41.921
I was in the area, so I came.

32:43.050 --> 32:43.820
How about this?

32:43.951 --> 32:44.951
I'll pack the stuff...

32:45.020 --> 32:46.391
and take it to you tonight, okay?

32:54.931 --> 32:55.760
This...

32:56.060 --> 32:57.800
The dumplings are ready.

32:58.270 --> 32:59.901
Come on, baby.

33:01.871 --> 33:02.841
I'll take it to you tonight.

33:02.901 --> 33:04.111
- Who is it? - Wait.

33:08.540 --> 33:09.211
Qin Qin.

33:23.530 --> 33:24.330
Why are you here?

33:28.101 --> 33:28.931
Have you eaten?

33:29.201 --> 33:30.230
How about some dumplings?

33:33.901 --> 33:34.770
Have a melon.

33:48.881 --> 33:49.851
Come on.

33:52.351 --> 33:53.220
Jiang Yi.

33:59.790 --> 34:01.401
These youngsters have only been here for half a month.

34:01.461 --> 34:02.401
But they're quite good.

34:04.631 --> 34:05.800
Do you think...

34:06.171 --> 34:07.101
they're paid for nothing?

34:07.171 --> 34:08.470
Forget it, you miser.

34:09.270 --> 34:09.970
I'm a miser?

34:10.911 --> 34:12.010
After you get married,

34:13.211 --> 34:14.211
you'll ask me for advice.

34:14.810 --> 34:15.681
When did you get married?

34:17.310 --> 34:18.711
- I got my certificate. - Save it.

34:19.180 --> 34:20.651
- Hurry! - Quick!

34:20.721 --> 34:21.480
Faster!

34:21.551 --> 34:22.950
Hurry up. The one at the back.

34:33.261 --> 34:34.000
Chief.

34:34.261 --> 34:35.031
What's the time?

34:38.270 --> 34:39.370
You barely passed.

34:40.241 --> 34:41.071
Chief.

34:41.270 --> 34:43.200
I just passed my personal best.

34:43.711 --> 34:44.640
Why is it still barely a pass?

34:44.711 --> 34:45.841
It's good enough for the normal stations.

34:45.910 --> 34:47.111
But for a special force station,

34:47.241 --> 34:48.211
it's not good enough.

34:50.040 --> 34:50.980
The three at the back,

34:51.250 --> 34:52.051
failed.

34:56.180 --> 34:56.950
Guys!

34:57.551 --> 34:58.750
What do you do when you fail?

34:59.020 --> 35:00.221
- Continue! - Continue!

35:00.721 --> 35:02.520
- Come on, gather around. - Come on.

35:02.620 --> 35:03.361
Let's go.

35:06.801 --> 35:07.531
Not bad.

35:22.241 --> 35:23.810
Are you sure you want to move tomorrow?

35:23.881 --> 35:25.551
I'm afraid I can't finish packing.

35:26.580 --> 35:27.821
I said I'll do it.

35:27.881 --> 35:29.321
Don't worry.

35:39.560 --> 35:40.531
Xiao Yi Xiao and my brother...

35:40.600 --> 35:41.961
invited me to a barbecue tonight.

35:42.330 --> 35:43.430
They asked you to come too.

35:49.000 --> 35:50.341
You can go if you want to.

35:50.711 --> 35:52.040
Don't go if you don't want to.

35:54.310 --> 35:55.080
I'll go.

35:55.711 --> 35:56.480
Why not?

36:01.950 --> 36:03.321
Then let's have some drinks tonight.

36:06.421 --> 36:07.290
What did you say?

36:10.120 --> 36:11.560
It's okay to drink more.

36:11.930 --> 36:13.390
I'm not afraid with you there.

36:32.350 --> 36:33.151
Go on.

36:44.191 --> 36:44.961
My dear Mr. Meng.

36:45.461 --> 36:46.830
How have you been?

36:47.830 --> 36:48.600
I'm good.

36:49.230 --> 36:51.370
I think you're in your element...

36:51.430 --> 36:53.301
in your family's Guokun Group.

36:54.100 --> 36:54.870
They're here.

37:06.080 --> 37:07.281
Let's shake hands too.

37:10.390 --> 37:11.191
Have a seat.

37:13.491 --> 37:15.160
- This place is nice. - Right?

37:15.390 --> 37:16.421
The drinks and food are good.

37:16.491 --> 37:17.730
- Ms. Hong is nice too. - Yes.

37:17.861 --> 37:19.390
This is our little stronghold.

37:19.461 --> 37:20.301
Try the food later.

37:20.361 --> 37:22.131
I heard compliments about me from the kitchen.

37:22.200 --> 37:23.160
- Ms. Hong, hurry up. - What's up?

37:23.230 --> 37:24.901
- We're waiting for you. - Did you eat honey today?

37:26.200 --> 37:27.341
We have a new friend.

37:27.401 --> 37:29.241
See what you'd like to eat and order it.

37:29.500 --> 37:30.540
Let me introduce you.

37:30.841 --> 37:32.711
This is Qin Er's boyfriend.

37:34.080 --> 37:34.881
Qin Er...

37:35.341 --> 37:36.910
Really? That's great.

37:38.651 --> 37:39.651
Gosh.

37:39.711 --> 37:41.850
From the looks of it, you two do look like a couple.

37:42.480 --> 37:43.151
All right.

37:43.221 --> 37:45.450
Today, I will personally cook for you.

37:45.520 --> 37:46.450
How about that?

37:47.520 --> 37:48.290
If you said so earlier,

37:48.361 --> 37:50.660
I'd bring a different bride here every day.

37:50.930 --> 37:52.560
Then you'll cook for us every day.

37:52.790 --> 37:54.060
Stop the nonsense.

37:54.131 --> 37:55.961
Order more. I'll serve the wine.

37:56.031 --> 37:58.930
(Fireworks of the heart)

38:00.100 --> 38:01.941
(Those years, the skewers we ate together)

39:09.841 --> 39:10.671
Come.

39:31.131 --> 39:31.890
Song Yan.

39:36.261 --> 39:37.430
It must have been hard for you...

39:38.301 --> 39:39.631
these past ten years.

39:43.941 --> 39:44.841
It was worth it.

39:46.471 --> 39:47.281
Really?

39:48.611 --> 39:49.410
Really.

39:50.711 --> 39:52.310
The training is a bit tough,

39:52.881 --> 39:54.350
but that's how it is for firefighters.

39:57.390 --> 39:59.191
What about when you were in the army?

39:59.991 --> 40:00.961
It's about the same.

40:02.591 --> 40:03.790
I took an oath when I enlisted...

40:04.261 --> 40:05.191
to work hard...

40:05.330 --> 40:06.361
and strive hard.

40:06.991 --> 40:07.861
I'll just endure it.

40:08.660 --> 40:10.401
A little suffering...

40:10.801 --> 40:11.571
is nothing.

40:13.500 --> 40:14.301
You took an oath?

40:16.441 --> 40:17.941
What is the oath of a soldier?

40:18.540 --> 40:19.211
I want to hear it.

40:21.741 --> 40:22.841
Let me think.

40:29.051 --> 40:30.180
Serve the people.

40:31.721 --> 40:32.620
Don't be afraid of sacrifice.

40:33.350 --> 40:34.361
Be loyal to your duty.

40:34.961 --> 40:35.790
Work hard.

40:36.921 --> 40:37.790
Strive hard.

40:39.031 --> 40:40.461
Under no circumstances...

40:41.230 --> 40:42.600
will I betray my country...

40:43.830 --> 40:45.071
or betray the army.

40:53.441 --> 40:54.910
Nor will I betray you.
